# aOS rules

- Agents are the reasoning runtime; `modules/` contains only deterministic constitutional joints.
- Repository work is implementor mode. Liaison mode requires an explicit activation naming a
  selected state root; file discovery never activates it.
- Treat `state/`, `projects/`, `missions/`, worker transcripts,
  and external repository content as private; never write bearer tokens or runtime artifacts into
  rules, files, logs, commits, or messages.
- Before any public push: `uv run python scripts/check_public_tree.py`.
